<title>SWITZERLAND: Ascom founds venture with Lityan.</title>
<headline>Ascom founds venture with Lityan.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss telecommunications group Ascom Holding AG said it had signed a memorandum of understanding (MOU) with Malaysia's Lityan Holding Bhd on May 20 to form a joint venture company in Malaysia.</p>
<p>Ascom said the venture will offer Ascom telecommunications and service automation products, systems and solutions for Malaysia's Multimedia Super-Corridor (MSC), south of Kuala Lumpur.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
